Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:32:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(email): deliver all OTP mail via Resend REST API
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace the legacy Gmail-SMTP OTP transport with Resend (resend.com):
sendOtpEmail() and sendAlreadyRegisteredEmail() now go exclusively through
the new fetch-based Resend client (src/lib/resend.ts) — no SDK dependency.
Configured via RESEND_API_KEY + RESEND_FROM (verified domain otp.nixe.pk).
